  m_text: 'Click letters that touch (diagonals too) to spell a word of 3+ letters.


    Only
    real words light up Attack. Your Albularyo walks up and strikes; longer words
    and rare letters hit harder.


    Used tiles vanish and new ones fall in. 5+
    letter words earn buffs.


    Defeat each creature and face the boss at the
    end of the chapter.'
